HAI
    WAZZUP
        I HAS A emptyString ITZ ""
        I HAS A normalString ITZ "Hello"
        I HAS A numericString ITZ "123"
        I HAS A result1
        I HAS A result2
        I HAS A result3
    BUHBYE

    result1 R MAEK emptyString A TROOF
    result2 R MAEK normalString A TROOF
    result3 R MAEK numericString A TROOF

    VISIBLE result1
    VISIBLE result2
    VISIBLE result3
KTHXBYE